#!/usr/bin/env python3
"""AtgSniffer - read-only TCP proxy for ATG Minimap -> Capture diagnostics.

This program does not import, patch, or modify 9555.py. It forwards the byte
stream unchanged between the game client and a local 9555.py backend while
observing Sproto frames. It logs only after the backend has confirmed that the
connection successfully selected TARGET_CHAR_ID (character_pick, tag 105).

Serv00 layout (keeps the login server's advertised game port unchanged):
  client -> public :15678 -> AtgSniffer -> 127.0.0.1:14171 -> 9555.py

Start the unchanged 9555.py process with PORT=14171. The sniffer owns :15678.
No Windows hosts-file or portproxy redirect is needed.

Capture protocol audited against the supplied Unity client:
  310 request_domin_info -> push 684 ret_domin_info
  311 enter_domin_pk_scene -> map 503, client map_ready 100, enemy 544, fight 547
  312 require_domin_rewards -> reward popup 638 and refreshed board 684

Python standard library only.
"""
